  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Governance for the SDGs (Sust.GOV)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project views governance, in particular SDG 16, promoting effective, accountable and inclusive institutions as a foundational condition and a key &quot;enabler&quot; for all SDGs, and will build HEI capacity for teaching and research in humanities and social sciences for HEI contribution to facilitate implementation of Agenda 2030 and the SDGs. Research on governance, policy coherence, private sector investment and SDG implementation can  be used in policy making and teachingmodules at partner instit.</narrative>
  </description>
